   "source_tag": "tformat",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Tries to perform a killing blow, doing %d%% weapon damage and dealing an automatic critical hit. If the target ends up with low enough life (<20%%), it might be instantly killed.\n\t\tAt level 4, it drains half your remaining stamina, and uses it to increase the blow damage by 100%% of it.\n\t\tThe chance to instantly kill will increase with your Physical Power.",
   "target": "试图施展一次致命打击，造成 %d%% 武器伤害，本次攻击自动变成暴击。如果打击后目标生命值低于 20%%，则有可能被直接杀死。\n\t\t在等级 4 时，本次攻击会消耗你剩余体力值的一半，并按其 100%% 提高本次攻击的物理强度。\n\t\t目标即死的概率受物理强度加成。",
